e":"先任元嘉二十一年官後因母喪去職，二十三年再起。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui:p003","start_codepoint":28,"end_codepoint":32,"human_reviewed":false,"year_bounds":[444,446],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui","source_id":"s-songshu-092-luhui-ws2195614"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-song092-luhui-mother","subject_person_id":"t6x_0wm_0k5","object_person_id":"9ix_lz2_kfo","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"母憂去職","reading_basis":{"kind":"song092_prose_kin","unit":"luhui"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-092","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui","source_id":"s-songshu-092-luhui-ws2195614","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui:p003","quote":"二十一年，徵以為南平王鑠冠軍司馬、長沙內史，行湘州府事。母憂去職。張尋、趙廣為亂於益州，兵寇之餘，政荒民擾。二十三年，乃追徽為持節、督益寧二州諸軍事、寧朔將軍、益州刺史，隱卹有方，威惠兼著，寇盜靜息，民物殷阜，蜀土安說，至今稱之。二十九年，卒，時年六十二。身亡之日，家無餘財，太祖甚痛惜之。詔曰：「徽厲志廉潔，歷任恪勤，奉公盡誠，克己無倦。襃榮未申，不幸夙殞，言念在懷，以為傷恨。可贈輔國將軍，本官如故。」賜錢十萬，米二百斛。諡曰簡子。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui:p003:m0061","object_person_reference_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui:p003:r0028"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"承陸徽歷官，母憂去職。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[],"relations":[{"id":"a-song092-luhui-mother","subject_person_id":"t6x_0wm_0k5","object_person_id":"9ix_lz2_kfo","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"母憂去職","reading_basis":{"kind":"song092_prose_kin","unit":"luhui"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-092","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui","source_id":"s-songshu-092-luhui-ws2195614","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-luhui:p003","quote":"二十一年，徵以為南平王鑠冠軍司馬、長沙內史，行湘州府事。母憂去職。張尋、趙廣為亂於益州，兵寇之餘，政荒民擾。二十三年，乃追徽為持節、督益寧二州諸軍事、寧朔將軍、益州刺史，隱卹有方，威惠兼著，寇盜靜息，民物殷阜，蜀土安說，至今稱之。二十九年，卒，時年六十二。身亡之日，家無餘財，太祖甚痛惜之。詔曰：「徽厲志廉潔，歷任恪勤，奉公盡誠，克己無倦。襃榮未申，不幸夙殞，言念在懷，以為傷恨。可贈輔國將軍，本官如故